Yes, I have 1.1 and 2.0 confused (surely not alone in this in this conversa=
tion).=A0 The other questions remain.=A0 How many platform-independent type=
setting formats are there and how intertranslatable are they? (given the te=
ndency toward proprietary software in some circles, I fear the answers are =
"many" and "not very").=A0 Pick one, strip back to ASCII (which has the vir=
tue of being everywhere readable) and rebuild.=A0 That will be faster than =
all the fiddling and also give back the control that the other systems seem=
 to have problems with.=A0 But what do I know?




